ts were available starting January 21, 2021.  Owners of other models will be notified as remedy parts become available.  Remedy parts should be available for all affected vehicles by late March 2021.  Owners may contact Toyota customer service at 1-888-270-9371 or Lexus customer service at 1-800-255-3987.  Note: This recall is an expansion of recall 20V-012.  Toyota's number for this recall is 20TA02.  Lexus' number for this recall is 20LA01.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":1525742,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=20V682000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":65,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2020","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA"},{"year":"2017","make":"LEXUS","model":"RX350"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"GS300"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"GS 350"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"IS 350"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"RX350"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"RC 300"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"RC 350"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"IS 300"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"LS500"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"ES350"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"LX570"},{"year":"2018","make":"LEXUS","model":"NX300"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"NX300"},{"year":"2019","make":"LEXUS","model":"GX460"},{"year":"2018","make":"TOYOTA","model":"HIGHLANDER"},{"year":"2018","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA"},{"year":"2018","make":"TOYOTA","model":"TACOMA"},{"year":"2018","make":"LEXUS","model":"GS 350"},{"year":"2019","make":"TOYOTA","model":"AVALON"},{"year":"2019","make":"TOYOTA","model":"4RUNNER"},{"year":"2019","make":"TOYOTA","model":"CAMRY"},{"year":"2019","make":"TOYOTA","model":"HIGHLANDER"},{"year":"2019","make":"TOYOTA","model":"LAND CRUISER"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":true},{"campaign":"19V532000","received":"2019-07-16","manufacturer":"Braun Corporation","component":"STEERING","summary":"Braun Corporation (Braun) is recalling certain modified 2017-2020 Toyota Sienna vehicles.  The steering shaft extensions may have been improperly manufactured, possibly causing the extensions to fracture.","consequence":"If the steering shaft extension completely fractures, it can cause a loss of steering, increasing the risk of a crash.","remedy":"Braun has notified owners, and dealers will replace the steering shaft extensions, free of charge.  The recall began July 25, 2019.  Owners may contact Braun customer service at 1-800-488-0359.","park_it":false,"park_outside":false,"over_the_air":false,"has_potential_units":true,"potential_units":595,"potential_units_source_url":"https://api.nhtsa.gov/recalls/campaignNumber?campaignNumber=19V532000","potential_units_source_title":"NHTSA Recalls API (campaignNumber)","campaign_vehicle_count":4,"campaign_vehicles":[{"year":"2017","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA"},{"year":"2020","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA"},{"year":"2019","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA"},{"year":"2018","make":"TOYOTA","model":"SIENNA"}],"campaign_vehicles_truncated":false}]}
